      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/kitab-al-ghayba-numani:2:10:25",
      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/22/2/10/25",
      "text": [
        ": قلت له: إنا نروي بأنّ صاحب هذا الأمر يُفقد زماناً، فكيف نصنع عند ذلك؟ قال: تمسكوا بالأمرِ الأول الذي أنتم عليه حتى يبين لكم."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.abdullah-al-shahin": [
          "(5) Muhammad bin Eessa and al-Hasan bin Ddhareef narrated that al-Harith bin al-Mugheera an-Nasri had said: I said to Abu Abdullah as-Sadiq (as): “We have tradition saying that the imam will be missed in some period of time. What will we do then?” He said: “Keep to the previous one that you have kept to until the matter becomes clear.”"
        ]
      }
